  iso:provenanceClause "5.5" ;
  iso:definition "Physical-asset-holding organizations should embrace the development of common terminology within their organization. This is to ensure that all stakeholders have a clear understanding and agreement in relation to the meaning of various terms commonly employed in differing professional sectors such as finance, operations, information and communications technology (ICT), etc." ;
  iso:pdmRelevance "medium" .

iso:term_information_system a iso:Concept ;
