  iso:provenanceStandard "ISO/TS 55010:2019" ;
  iso:provenanceClause "6.3" ;
  iso:definition "Data management is a subset of information management. It comprises all disciplines related to managing data that are used by the organization in both financial and non-financial functions." ;
  iso:pdmRelevance "high" .

