  iso:provenanceStandard "ISO/TS 55010:2019" ;
  iso:provenanceClause "7.2" ;
  iso:definition "Financial asset registers are used for managing the organization's financial functions. They are used for financial reporting purposes, as well as for other activities, including accounting, taxation, insurance, valuation and legal requirements." ;
