  iso:provenanceClause "E.5" ;
  iso:definition "Operation and maintenance (O&M) costs often represent a significant portion of an asset's life cycle costs. O&M directly and indirectly influence costs, level of service, risk, performance, reputation, etc. [...] The organization's operational functions should run the assets to produce the product and/or service to be delivered at the required level of service and acceptable level of risk." ;
